From ca3fc4dfd2268504461408e61f551a05973f9f07 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yann Collette <ycollette@adobe.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 17:10:54 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Fix curve crashes and harden audio startup

Correct curve bounds and segment counts, handle audio initialisation failures, and support Tcl 8.6 and 9 through pkg-config. Preserve debug symbols and add standalone curve and Tcl regressions with Fedora build instructions.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
